<h1>Subscription Cancellation Scheduled</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  We've received your cancellation request. Your subscription will remain
  active until <strong><%= @period_end&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></strong>,
  and you'll continue to have full access to all your plan features until then.
</p>

<p>After that date your account will switch to the Free plan.</p>

<table class="data-table" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #a8aaaf;">Status</td>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;">Cancels at period end</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #a8aaaf;">Access until</td>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;"><%= @period_end&.strftime("%B %d, %Y") || "—" %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
  Changed your mind? You can reactivate your subscription at any time before
  the period ends and keep all your current plan benefits.
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
  <a href="<%= ENV['DEV_HOST'] || 'https://thin.ly' %>/plans" class="button">Reactivate Subscription</a>
</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="<%= ENV['DEV_HOST'] || 'https://thin.ly' %>/" class="button button--secondary">Go to Dashboard</a>
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #a8aaaf;">
  If you have any questions, reply to this email or contact
  <a href="mailto:support@thin.ly" style="color: #a8aaaf;">support@thin.ly</a>.
</p>
